[00:41.94]A room in complete darkness
[00:47.32]Is like being in your arms
[00:52.70]And outside that very door
[00:58.26]Is my mate who has gone home
[01:25.46]I feel the tide coming in
[01:30.73]To take me far away again.
[01:36.04]Close your eyes and pass through the flames
[01:41.34]To the foothill, where rises the daily smoke
[01:46.76]Touch, with eyes open
[01:52.09]Wash off the dirt from your face
[01:57.43]Those who left will eventually arrive.
[02:02.73]I quietly raise my heart
[02:59.06]I feel the tide coming in
[03:04.17]To take me far away again.
